'''Team of Two''' (二人一組, ''Futari Hito Kumi'', '''Pair''') is a 5-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (M): Cats' health increases by 20%.

